{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2022-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1663286400, "end_date": 1663891199, "month_true_total": 86, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:51:01 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "122644652", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048958437", "personaname": "Ladria", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198048958437/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1605, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 463, "last_played": 1673895566, "avatar": "110f6456bd38b09f01aa91c0483efb9cea9cf678"}, "language": "english", "review": "I played with my partner for 7 hours and defeated the \"final boss\" on the normal difficulty level for the first time. Having played comparable games like Gunfire Reborn, I can say that the level design is more varied in comparison.\nThe different environments feel very organic. The weapon selection is top, there is something for every type of player and the classes feel very different. The boss fights are fun --> you can blow yourself up ;) and also, visually, the game looks great!\n\nSo grab a friend and enjoy the Early Access, in which there is already a lot inside!\n\nBonus: I met the developers at Gamescom, they are really nice guys.", "timestamp_created": 1663873326, "timestamp_updated": 1663873326, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525547444820404053", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 2}]}, {"recommendationid": "122636515", "author": {"steamid": "76561198203585420", "personaname": "Introverted_Grizzly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198203585420/", "num_games_owned": 336, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 5877, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 988, "last_played": 1787175324, "avatar": "75d7997e9110dcbb7f1962d8f911d2e08306d752"}, "language": "english", "review": "Do yourself a favor and get this game.\n\nOn sale? Get it. Not on sale? Get it. Wasn't expecting to have so much fun with this title, but for an EA game there is a lot there. I'm still discovering weapons, and still have environments to unlock.\n\nIt's tough, but rewarding, and the music bangs. If you like roguelites akin to ROR or Enter the Gungeon, with the locomotion and pacing of DOOM, this is for you.", "timestamp_created": 1663863074, "timestamp_updated": 1663863074, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122611680", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970681453", "personaname": "Terminal Magic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GatorHugger619/", "num_games_owned": 1455, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 459, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 357, "last_played": 1725186238, "avatar": "0c217ccc0b1af0b41888a8466f22106bf317e78a"}, "language": "english", "review": "First singleplayer FPS in a long time to really grab me. Co-op is fun too. It's all fun.", "timestamp_created": 1663817474, "timestamp_updated": 1663817474, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122607818", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095793192", "personaname": "JR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jrfresh/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 3155, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2353, "last_played": 1738526883, "avatar": "b2a734431d40a6c110b7c09b1b3b65ad5819c79f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Sick game. You gotta love these devs for keeping it fresh with the updates. Movement is spot on, shooting is fun. A lot of variety with weapons, I'd like to see more gadgets and a couple more classes.\n\nHonestly it's hard to pinpoint something wrong with the game, I don't even remember how much I paid for this and I can't be bothered to check right now. It's a great game, get it!", "timestamp_created": 1663810338, "timestamp_updated": 1663810338, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122600978", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071187082", "personaname": "st3pa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/st3pa333/", "num_games_owned": 62, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 9436, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4970, "last_played": 1740539412, "avatar": "86e289627d8c3b4ca217a6b2a5a084b140aaa4de"}, "language": "english", "review": "Solid", "timestamp_created": 1663796499, "timestamp_updated": 1663796499, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}